# This repo is authored on Windows but built on Linux (Vercel, Supabase Edge
# Functions, EAS). Normalise to LF in the repository so CRLF never reaches a
# deploy target or shows up as whole-file diff noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets git should not try to normalise.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
